{"id":"76ef73eede092f01","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-omega-jump-invariance.md","title":"ω 跳跃在度上良定义","display":"thm-omega-jump-invariance — ω 跳跃在度上良定义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-omega-jump-invariance","aliases":["20-thm-omega-jump-invariance"],"display":"thm-omega-jump-invariance — ω 跳跃在度上良定义","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.5.9","source_printed_pages":[144],"source_pdf_pages":[178],"depends_on":["[[20-df-omega-jump]]","[[20-thm-jump]]","[[20-thm-relative-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-omega-jump-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-omega-jump-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-jump-invariance — ω 跳跃在度上良定义"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.5.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>178</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4f5b9a29710000f\" href=\"?note=e4f5b9a29710000f\" title=\"20-df-omega-jump\">20-df-omega-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e4f5b9a29710000f\" href=\"?note=e4f5b9a29710000f\" title=\"20-df-omega-jump\">20-df-omega-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}jump\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\nA\\le_TB\\Rightarrow A^{(\\omega)}\\le_TB^{(\\omega)},\\qquad A\\equiv_TB\\Rightarrow A^{(\\omega)}\\equiv_TB^{(\\omega)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}jump\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\nA\\le_TB\\Rightarrow A^{(\\omega)}\\le_TB^{(\\omega)},\\qquad A\\equiv_TB\\Rightarrow A^{(\\omega)}\\equiv_TB^{(\\omega)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-oracle 程序指标。跳跃单调性证明的程序替换是有效的：从一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\le_TV\">\\(U\\le_TV\\)</span> 的指标，统一编译出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U&#39;\\le_TV&#39;\">\\(U&#39;\\le_TV&#39;\\)</span> 的指标，方法是把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 查询替换成给定模拟，并将停止问题经参数定理转成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V&#39;\">\\(V&#39;\\)</span> 的成员问题。反复应用该有效编译器，得到一个普通可计算的函数，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n)}\\le_TB^{(n)}\">\\(A^{(n)}\\le_TB^{(n)}\\)</span> 的程序指标。</p>\n<p>输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,n\\rangle\\)</span>，用该第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层程序模拟，每次询问 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in B^{(n)}\">\\(z\\in B^{(n)}\\)</span> 都转成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle z,n\\rangle\\in B^{(\\omega)}\">\\(\\langle z,n\\rangle\\in B^{(\\omega)}\\)</span>，得到统一归约。反向对称应用即可。这一步统一性是证明核心，不能省略。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.5.9；印刷页 144；PDF 第 178 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-omega-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e4f5b9a29710000f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-omega-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-omega-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e4f5b9a29710000f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-omega-jump]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-omega-jump]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-omega-jump]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}jump\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\nA\\le_TB\\Rightarrow A^{(\\omega)}\\le_TB^{(\\omega)},\\qquad A\\equiv_TB\\Rightarrow A^{(\\omega)}\\equiv_TB^{(\\omega)}.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"U\\le_TV","display":false},{"tex":"U'\\le_TV'","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"V'","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"A^{(n)}\\le_TB^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in B^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle z,n\\rangle\\in B^{(\\omega)}","display":false}],"bytes":1677,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e4f5b9a29710000f","2ea8548c98f572c3","8b6134451906e575"]}